 "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/blogger/v3/blogs/6417357851361576411/posts/7391839948283195249",
 "title": "Is Fate is True?",
 "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span><u><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i>Is Fate is True?</i></span></u></span></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></u></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Having said that, there are other tactics to take control of your life by being aware of your destiny. We have studied how to lead and use life paths with numbers and numerology, but one way to uncover one's destiny is to use it as a guide for one's decisions. People who live according to their purpose are happier, more successful and able to find meaning in life.&nbsp;</span></i></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></i></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJDAaDGgcwtme_7czvrkTOX9vy8bRtGrlt05t-Kguk_XVywOLKNM1ZLzvL3V42aWcK7gwWhtm9Vd6U__Dg6X7cfnJir41PGS-ySzf4o8fkBd8t6B4Q6eozz7neewwJ6KOSaS1H3aQwP0Sv/s1920/luck-5214413_1920.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1280\" data-original-width=\"1920\" height=\"266\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJDAaDGgcwtme_7czvrkTOX9vy8bRtGrlt05t-Kguk_XVywOLKNM1ZLzvL3V42aWcK7gwWhtm9Vd6U__Dg6X7cfnJir41PGS-ySzf4o8fkBd8t6B4Q6eozz7neewwJ6KOSaS1H3aQwP0Sv/w400-h266/luck-5214413_1920.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><br />&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> No matter how great your destiny, you will never reach your full potential without taking control of your life. Fate will happen if you do not take responsibility for your life, and it will happen if you do not commit yourself to growing, learning and taking risks. The determination of size is based on active, conscious decisions.&nbsp;</span></i></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Fate will only come if one lets oneself be dictated by other people and external circumstances. The most important thing to remember is that there are infinite possibilities in life.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />If you believe in fate, you will feel satisfied with the knowledge that you are who you are and are destined to go through life. In contrast, you may feel trapped and constrained by the idea of fate and destiny.</span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhEAI81Est4289VhiQ5wO6ftamLY_Hqv5dYsd6rw7Dd72Oy-mMdjooY0UxPW8fTqUI8tigV-3no-XWcUfzKwHTPPs8arQCpWHbsoPQ8sRREG-sScr4WXOhyphenhyphenTT1MEA1PCtytE9NKt4xeCM-X/s1920/fate-2050839_1920.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"870\" data-original-width=\"1920\" height=\"181\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhEAI81Est4289VhiQ5wO6ftamLY_Hqv5dYsd6rw7Dd72Oy-mMdjooY0UxPW8fTqUI8tigV-3no-XWcUfzKwHTPPs8arQCpWHbsoPQ8sRREG-sScr4WXOhyphenhyphenTT1MEA1PCtytE9NKt4xeCM-X/w400-h181/fate-2050839_1920.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></i></span></span></span></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The concept of fate or destiny enables most people to live their lives the way they want, and to believe that whatever happens to them is their decision. In this way, it relieves them of any real responsibility for their circumstances.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />Destiny and destiny are terms that are often used interchangeably in conversation. Fate and destiny intertwine when they deal with the future. Destiny refers to destiny (from the Latin fatum, \"decree\" or \"prediction\") and destiny is a predetermined course of events. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />The use of the words \"destiny\" and \"destiny\" has different connotations. In everyday language, destiny and destiny are synonymous, but in terms of nineteenth-century philosophy, the terms have taken on a different meaning. Traditional use defines fate as the power or agency to predetermine the order or course of events.</span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i></i></span></span></span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkdVNGqI3kC3uYZABMs99qBDZTiyYzqLEbzaf0sfTxGg2toRVR7F7V9e8VfTs-G9kJ01nvqbTYZ32PqIGYLIWTrKhfgOtMCc4_5GLVx_OYQHmhEb6CRFIrID4Shyz8rQM-YEprwbsAv0YF/s1920/clock-2535061_1920.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1440\" data-original-width=\"1920\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkdVNGqI3kC3uYZABMs99qBDZTiyYzqLEbzaf0sfTxGg2toRVR7F7V9e8VfTs-G9kJ01nvqbTYZ32PqIGYLIWTrKhfgOtMCc4_5GLVx_OYQHmhEb6CRFIrID4Shyz8rQM-YEprwbsAv0YF/w400-h300/clock-2535061_1920.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />For Arthur Schopenhauer, fate is the manifestation of the will to live and to live at the same time; fate is the decision to overwhelm fate with the art of morality (asceticism). For Friedrich Nietzsche, fate was maintained in the form of amor fati (love), and fate was an important element in his philosophy of willpower (The Will to Power), the basis of human behavior influenced by the will to live (Schopenhauers Will). As for destiny, it is considered the course that life takes, and karma as one of the factors that influence it. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />Karma does not lead to fatalistic thoughts, but it is a factor that determines our destiny and our destiny. The existence of empires known as Hell and the Spirit World proves that the fate of a person is not 100% clear. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />In other words, people are responsible for their own destiny and will go to hell and take responsibility for their own wrong decisions. No one born on this earth has a plan to go to hell, but more than half of all people today go to hell when they die. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />When we abandon our lives to fate, we hand over control to other people and external circumstances. If we do not strive to change and evolve, something will happen to fate. Fate occurs when we ignore our life calls, do not work hard enough, and reconnect with our true nature.</span></i></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />We come to this earth with our prescribed births and deaths, our predestined destinies in our hands and those we want the best to happen in our lives. We are a society where people pat themselves on the back when they succeed and leave the rest to fate. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />I often wonder whether fate is human and whether each of us feels that we are being labelled as undesirable. I want not only to assign fate, but also to investigate failure: loss of business, loss of wealth, failed relationships, failed health, deterioration of the career ladder, and the list goes on. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />Throughout my life, from the age of eight, I have always had a firm belief that destiny is real. Happiness, bad luck, the extent of the afterlife, ghosts, spirits, gods, karma, fate, etc. If you're wondering about the film that changed my life forever, it's called Fools Rush, and if you've seen it and are in your situation, it's not fate, it's one of the films that changed your life forever.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i></i></span></span></span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_fBOlJTKt6DbjU05hbf8ajcSHUDgW2cx6RIKRZg5kHHWCU-Ev8WrzXdo2nckSJcc8yDh9kyPyI5efC_LFLxDrpD1EEFqg1NuSKn8hwcDT81LPaeUndpnFUN_yLMCLE8ZrVvBCuUeQMFTO/s2048/danica-tanjutco-N7CzWylkOhA-unsplash.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_fBOlJTKt6DbjU05hbf8ajcSHUDgW2cx6RIKRZg5kHHWCU-Ev8WrzXdo2nckSJcc8yDh9kyPyI5efC_LFLxDrpD1EEFqg1NuSKn8hwcDT81LPaeUndpnFUN_yLMCLE8ZrVvBCuUeQMFTO/w400-h300/danica-tanjutco-N7CzWylkOhA-unsplash.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br />Try to think of your fate as a fate that provides you with a broad template for your life that you can color at will. In other words, there is only one way to fulfill your purpose in life, and it is up to you to decide. Accept the things to which fate binds you, and love the people to whom fate brings you, and those in your heart. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />Most people are so comfortable with fate and happiness that they do not even pronounce it, but fate and destiny are both sides of the same coin. I know several couples who met at an unexpected and perfect time and told amazing love stories. I think the same goes for relationships, and once you find one, you realise it's not going to work. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></i></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"></span></i></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #660000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><i></i></span></span></span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisu5tTr3JEFtrPG9O-3hLRu4354uQ7J5DVaxWLNatK7lak6fXzvH58Ialr1L44GjT9ddXgW9QliMNNEwcdNFYbZBljLJ_bctMlyQG98D0QUe8eKMNyAyKG-70a6bFhgIJ6b7zFb9Aporj4/s1920/cube-4399925_1920.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1440\" data-original-width=\"1920\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisu5tTr3JEFtrPG9O-3hLRu4354uQ7J5DVaxWLNatK7lak6fXzvH58Ialr1L44GjT9ddXgW9QliMNNEwcdNFYbZBljLJ_bctMlyQG98D0QUe8eKMNyAyKG-70a6bFhgIJ6b7zFb9Aporj4/w400-h300/cube-4399925_1920.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></i></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><i><br /><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br />The unknown future currently determines a significant part of our lives. It does not prevent us from being what we are, living and breathing, a unique contrast to the whole of creation. The decisions we make now, and how they are made, can change the outcome. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />I believe that destiny exists and that in every situation we can make decisions about what we want to do with our lives. If I make the wrong choice, I do not sweat, because at the end of the day I know where it will lead me and what I mean by all faith in destiny. If fate shows its hand and we do good, then we can accept the consequences of our decisions and our trust.&nbsp; </span></i></span><u><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i></i></span></u></p><p><u><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i><br /></i></span></u></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><i><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i><span style=\"color: red;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\">Thanks for reading this blog,please share with others and help us to grow<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">.</span></span></span></b></span></i></span></u></span></span></i><i><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /><br /><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><b><br /></b></u></span></span></span></i></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><b>Please visit this blog again!!!we uploads articles daily!!!!😀😀</b></u></span></span></span></i></span></h2><p></p>",
